---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
const trail = [{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Terms', href: '/terms/' }];
---
<Page
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms covering use of Going Eagle, including the limits of the golf advice and calculators published here."
  intro="Plain terms for a content site. Nothing unusual, but worth stating."
  trail={trail}
>
  <h2>What this site is</h2>
  <p>
    Going Eagle publishes golf instruction, equipment guidance and free calculators. It is
    general information, not personal coaching. Golf technique is individual, and advice that
    helps one player can hurt another — which is why we recommend a qualified coach for anything
    that matters to you.
  </p>

  <h2>The calculators</h2>
  <p>
    Our tools produce estimates using published methods. The handicap calculator in particular is
    <strong>not an official handicap index</strong> and does not apply every adjustment a golf
    association would. Do not use it for competition purposes. Each tool states its own limits on
    its page.
  </p>

  <h2>Injury and physical risk</h2>
  <p>
    Golf swings put load on the back, wrists and elbows. If you have an injury or a medical
    condition, take advice from a qualified professional before changing your technique or your
    practice volume.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to be accurate and we correct mistakes when we find them or when readers report
    them. We cannot guarantee that every detail is current at the moment you read it, particularly
    for prices and product availability. Our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>
    describes how we keep pages current.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate relationships</h2>
  <p>
    We earn commission on some purchases made through our links, disclosed on every page that
    carries one. See the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">full disclosure</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Content ownership</h2>
  <p>
    The writing, diagrams and tools on this site are ours. Quote us with a link — do not republish
    pages wholesale.
  </p>
</Page>
